    "created_at": "2023-08-01T11:15:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-08-01T11:15:50Z",
    "body": "I think the authors of outer-page code will be surprised if the first fetch they kick off follow different security policies from the rest of the ones that follow it.\r\n\r\nIndeed, many web developers are used to an isomorphism: bundled code behaves the same as unbundled code. You are proposing to break that. So if anyone is presenting a more complex mental model, I believe it's your proposal.",
