    "created_at": "2023-08-01T12:00:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-08-01T12:00:35Z",
    "body": "There is only be a single fetch when the worker code is bundled, and this would be unchanged.  In unbundled code static imports would use a different CSP.  I don't think this makes bundled code behave differently from unbundled code any more than it does already by virtue of that fact that it doesn't make any subsequent fetches.",
